OL,11,     FLondon, DI Will Wagstaffe, a
OL,12,     Fworkaholic whose personal life is
OL,13,     Fas troubled and complex as his day
OL,14,     Fjob, investigates a string of
OL,15,     Fhorrifying murders.
OL,16,G0100 Judge Rinder's Crime Stories
OL,17,     FJudge Rinder rules the courtroom,
OL,18,     Fbut now the respected barrister
OL,19,     Fwith a background in criminal
OL,20,     Fdefence is stepping out from
OL,21,     Fbehind the bench to take on
OL,22,     Freal-life cases.
